<title>USA: GC Cos board clears stock buyback.</title>
<headline>GC Cos board clears stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTNUT HILL, Mass. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>GC Cos Inc said Monday directors authorized the company to repurchase up to one million common shares during the next 12 months.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be made through open market and private transactions, subject to the availability of the shares and market conditions, the company said. It has engaged Salomon Brothers as its agent for this stock buyback program.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
